OL,3,GNEWSAGrimsby Town fans 'appalled' by
OL,4,Amemorial theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grimsby Town supporters' group says
OL,7,Fit is "utterly appalled and
OL,8,Fheartbroken" after the memorial garden
OL,9,Fat Blundell Park was vandalised.
OL,11,FThe Mariners Trust said plants were
OL,12,Fremoved and items, including a shirt
OL,13,Fand a scarf, were stolen from the
OL,14,Fgarden in Cleethorpes.
OL,16,FSome of the stolen items had been left
OL,17,Fin memory of Alex Hughes, the club's
OL,18,Fhead of recruitment, who died suddenly
OL,19,Fearlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
