OL,3,GNEWSAGrimsby Town fans 'appalled' by
OL,4,Amemorial theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Mariners Trust
OL,7,Fsaid: "To target a place dedicated to
OL,8,Fsuch deeply personal memories is a
OL,9,Fdespicable and cowardly act that goes
OL,10,Fagainst everything our community and
OL,11,Fclub stand for."
